  "Description": "The RmzTabM package provides functions to read and write\nfiles in the HUPO-PSI mzTab-M file format for reporting of\nresults from metabolomics and lipidomics experiments. This\npackage represents the reference implementation for mzTab-M\nimport/export for R. Core, low level functions allow to format\nand parse the individual sections of the mzTab-M format. These\nfunctions are designed to be re-used by other packages\nimplementing import/export of results in mzTab-M.",
